//? Title: Burstsort: Actual Buckets, Bursts and Prefix Depth
//? Subtitle: The original nineteen words, configurable thresholds and explicit-stack native tracing
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Burstsort keeps related strings in leaf buckets and creates deeper trie nodes
only when a bucket exceeds its capacity. We retain the original nineteen-word
example and its first-letter plot, but inspect actual native nodes, slots and
burst events instead of inferring the trie from first-letter counts. The core
now uses string-index buckets, flat node ownership and explicit work stacks,
so long prefixes do not require recursive insertion, collection or destruction.
Measured controls show why the trie is not always shallow: eight identical
strings stay in a bucket, while nine can create one node per prefix byte.
The report discusses locality without claiming an unmeasured cache-speed win.
)

\toc

> The original words: one real burst under a

The input contains nine words beginning with a. The default capacity is eight,
and overflow means strictly *greater than* eight. The ninth a-word, almond,
arrives at original index eighteen and creates a child for prefix a. Its
second-byte slots are l, p, r and v; the p bucket contains six strings and
remains a leaf. Other first-byte slots remain root buckets.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/burstsort_trie.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  const std::vector<std::string> words{
      "banana","apple","apricot","avocado","blueberry","cherry","cranberry","coconut",
      "date","elderberry","fig","grape","guava","apple","apex","april","apply","arc","almond"};
  const auto trace=dm::algorithms::burstsort_trace(words);
  auto expected=words;std::sort(expected.begin(),expected.end());
  if (trace.output!=expected || trace.nodes.size()!=2 || trace.bursts.size()!=1 ||
      dm::algorithms::burstsort_prefix(trace,1)!="a") return 1;
  std::print("Sorted {} strings: {}.\nOriginal input ids in output: {}.\n\n",trace.output.size(),trace.output,trace.output_input_indices);
  std::print("| node id | actual prefix | depth | subtree strings | terminal input ids |\n"
             "| ---: | :--- | ---: | ---: | :--- |\n");
  for (std::size_t id=0;id<trace.nodes.size();++id) {
    const auto prefix=dm::algorithms::burstsort_prefix(trace,id);
    std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n",id,prefix.empty()?"(root)":prefix,trace.nodes[id].depth,
        trace.nodes[id].strings,trace.nodes[id].terminal_input_indices);
  }
  std::print("\n| owning node | slot byte | strings | child id (0 = leaf) | leaf input ids before sort | leaf ids after sort |\n"
             "| ---: | :--- | ---: | ---: | :--- | :--- |\n");
  for (const auto& slot:trace.slots)
    std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n",slot.node,static_cast<char>(slot.value),slot.strings,slot.child,
        slot.input_indices,slot.sorted_indices);
  dm::graphics::Diagram diagram(65,1100);
  dm::graphics::DiagramNodeStyle node;node.width=3.4;node.height=1.8;
  diagram.node("root",{0,0},std::format("root, depth 0\n{} strings",trace.nodes[0].strings),node);
  diagram.node("a",{-6,-3},std::format("prefix {}\ndepth {}\n{} strings",dm::algorithms::burstsort_prefix(trace,1),
      trace.nodes[1].depth,trace.nodes[1].strings),node).edge("root","a","a");
  dm::graphics::DiagramNodeStyle bucket;bucket.width=1.6;bucket.height=1.15;bucket.padding=6;bucket.font_size=15;bucket.fill={220,252,231};
  double root_x=-1,child_x=-9;
  for (const auto& slot:trace.slots) if (!slot.child) {
    const auto prefix=dm::algorithms::burstsort_prefix(trace,slot.node)+static_cast<char>(slot.value);
    const auto id=std::format("bucket_{}_{}",slot.node,static_cast<unsigned int>(slot.value));
    const double x=slot.node==0?root_x:child_x;
    if (slot.node==0) root_x+=2;else child_x+=3;
    diagram.node(id,{x,slot.node==0?-3.0:-6.0},std::format("{}\n{} strings",prefix,slot.strings),bucket)
        .edge(slot.node==0?"root":"a",id);
  }
  diagram.text({0,-7.5},"blue = actual trie nodes; green = actual leaf buckets",18)
      .save_svg("build/burstsort_trie.svg");
  const auto& burst=trace.bursts[0];
  std::print("\nActual burst: parent {}, slot {}, child {}, redistributed {} ids; trigger input {} = {}.\n",
      burst.node,static_cast<char>(burst.value),burst.child,burst.strings,burst.trigger_input_index,trace.input[burst.trigger_input_index]);
}
```
